---
title: "Serengeti 3-Day Fly-In Safari"
description: "Experience the Serengeti on a 3-day fly-in safari from Zanzibar with luxury tented camp, full-board dining and Great Migration game drives."
permalink: "/tours/serengeti-3day-flyin/index.html"
tour_slug: "serengeti-3day-flyin"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="tour-detail">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #b8860b 0%, var(--dct-spice) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-safari">SAF — Safari</span>
      <h1>Serengeti 3-day fly-in safari</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">3 days / 2 nights · Zanzibar → Serengeti → Zanzibar</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "serengeti-3day-flyin" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20serengeti%203day%20flyin" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Book via WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Experience the legendary Serengeti on a 3-day fly-in safari. Stay at a luxury tented camp inside the park, enjoy full-board dining, and witness the Great Migration (seasonal) or resident wildlife year-round.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>Day 1: Flight Zanzibar → Seronera, transfer to luxury tented camp, afternoon game drive</li>
      <li>Day 2: Full-day game drives in the Seronera valley (prime wildlife viewing area)</li>
      <li>Day 3: Morning game drive, flight back to Zanzibar</li>
      <li>All park fees, flights, accommodation, meals, and game drives included</li>
      <li>Professional guide and 4x4 safari vehicle</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Serengeti Wildlife Highlights in Pictures</h2>
        <p style="color: #5c727f; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          The Seronera Valley and northern river corridors offer the highest predator density in Africa:
        </p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'african-leopard-acacia-tree-serengeti.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'african-leopard-acacia-tree-serengeti.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Leopard in Acacia Tree</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Seronera riverine sausage trees provide prime leopard daylight perches.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'lions-resting-dry-savanna.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'lions-resting-dry-savanna.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Serengeti Lion Pride</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Dense prides stalking along kopjes and migratory river crossings.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'cheetah-serengeti-savanna-tanzania.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'cheetah-serengeti-savanna-tanzania.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Cheetah on the Hunt</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Namiri Plains and Ndutu grasslands are East Africa's top cheetah habitats.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'cape-buffalo-serengeti-tanzania.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'cape-buffalo-serengeti-tanzania.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Cape Buffalo Herds</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Hundreds of buffalo gathering around seasonal pans and marshlands.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'elephant-savanna-landscape-tanzania.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'elephant-savanna-landscape-tanzania.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Bush Elephant Families</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Matriarchal herds browsing along northern woodland margins.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'lilac-breasted-roller-tanzania-bird.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'lilac-breasted-roller-tanzania-bird.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Lilac-Breasted Roller</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Tanzania's national bird perched with vivid turquoise and lilac plumage.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 days / 2 nights</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Transferred from your Zanzibar hotel to ZNZ airport for flights</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Requires a licensed mainland tour operator — we handle all logistics</li>
      <li>Best for Great Migration (July–October: Mara River crossings; December–March: Ndutu calving season)</li>
      <li>Single supplement: add ~25% for solo travelers</li>
      <li>Weather-dependent flights — flexible date policy</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Flights, park fees, 4x4, guide, full board</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h4>📍 Tour Details</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">3 days / 2 nights</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Zanzibar → Serengeti → Zanzibar</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ "SAF" | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified planning range • TANAPA national park fees &amp; flights included • 30% deposit locks flight manifest</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
